@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Intégrations externes : ports et adaptateurs
left to right direction

package "Cœur métier" #EEF4F0 {
  [facturation] as FAC
  [pos / ventes / rh] as MET
  interface "PortPaiement\n+ initierEncaissement()\n+ initierDecaissement()\n+ consulterStatut()\n+ traiterNotification()" as PP
  interface "PortCertificationFiscale\n+ certifier(facture)\n+ verifierIfu(ifu)" as PF
  interface "PortMessagerie\n+ envoyer(message)" as PM
}

package "Adaptateurs (infrastructure)" #FBF5E3 {
  [SimulateurPaiement\n(développement, démonstration)] as SIM
  [AdaptateurAgregateur\n(contrat principal)] as AGR
  [AdaptateurOperateurDirect\n(évolution future)] as DIR
  [SimulateurFEC] as SFEC
  [AdaptateurDGI\n(selon spécifications officielles)] as DGI
  [AdaptateurSMS] as SMS
  [AdaptateurWhatsApp] as WA
  [AdaptateurSMTP] as MAIL
}

MET --> PP
FAC --> PF
MET --> PM
PP <|.. SIM
PP <|.. AGR
PP <|.. DIR
PF <|.. SFEC
PF <|.. DGI
PM <|.. SMS
PM <|.. WA
PM <|.. MAIL

note right of AGR
Choix de l'adaptateur par configuration,
par entreprise. Notifications entrantes
vérifiées (signature) et idempotentes.
end note
@enduml
